{"ref":"BDB, חֹ֫מֶר²","hw":"חֹ֫מֶר²","html":"II. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חֹ֫מֶר</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>heap</strong> (cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, חֲמוֹר\" href=\"/BDB,_חֲמוֹר\", dir=\"rtl\">i. חֲמוֹר</a>)—<span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ מַיִם רַבִּים</span> <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 3:15\" href=\"/Habakkuk.3.15\">Hb 3:15</a> <em>a heap of great waters</em> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">יָם</span>)—but text dub., v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, חָמַר\" href=\"/BDB,_חָמַר\", dir=\"rtl\">I. חמר</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֳמָרִים חֳמָרִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 8:10\" href=\"/Exodus.8.10\">Ex 8:10</a> (J), of dead frogs gathered in <em>heaps</em>.","next":"BDB, חֹ֫מֶר³","prev":"BDB, חמר"}